tool/train_ref.png


# Claude Code local state. Looks like a small settings folder and is not: it
# also holds agent worktrees with their own .dart_tool build output, which was
# 2.3 GB across 4,555 files when this entry was added. A stray `git add -A`
# would otherwise try to commit all of it.
/.claude/

# Golden-test failure dumps. `flutter test` writes the actual/expected/diff PNGs
# here on any golden mismatch; they are output, never source. Four of them were
# committed by accident in #32.
/test/failures/
